OL,3,ANoel Gallagher says Johnny Marr has
OL,4,A'always been gung-ho' with his guitars
OL,5,
OL,6,FNoel Gallagher has said singer Johnny
OL,7,FMarr has "always been a bit gung-ho"
OL,8,Fwith his guitars.
OL,10,FMarr, 62, is to auction almost 100 of
OL,11,Fhis guitars, including one he once sent
OL,12,Fto Oasis that left Gallagher worried it
OL,13,Fcould be damaged
OL,15,FThe Smiths musician said he was letting
OL,16,Fgo of his guitars because, "I didn't
OL,17,Flike the idea of my studio space
OL,18,Fbecoming a museum".
OL,20,FThe collection is on display in London
OL,21,Fbefore going under the hammer at
OL,22,FChristie's on 17 September.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
